flowchart TD
    A["Root runs the source installer; prepare local node and cluster identity"]
    B["Install root snapshot service, timer and non-root MQTT sender"]
    C["Reader-group runtime directory; root UID and GID command collects bounded local VM, CT, disk and SMART data"]
    D["Validate root-owned reader-group directory and atomically write snapshot; terminate failed process group"]
    E["Sender selects independent local clients for guests and SMART"]
    F{"Snapshot file, identity and sample time trusted?"}
    G["Read guest inventory and calculate rates from sample times; reuse repeated sample"]
    H["Read disk inventory and SMART from the same snapshot; normalize and evaluate alerts"]
    I["Partial SMART failures expose errors, retain affected alerts and old time, and do not report healthy"]
    J["Stale or invalid snapshot: guest error and SMART unavailable; preserve last known data"]
    K["Source upgrade backs up and restores prior units, runtime, snapshot and state on failure"]
    L["Tests cover trusted install paths, fixed command, collection, snapshot, sender and recovery"]
    M["Direct source installer rejects an existing runtime and directs source upgrade"]
    N["Isolated systemd smoke validates runtime parent and uses root-GID pvesh fixture; verify live snapshot, reader permissions and fresh MQTT; clean only owned resources"]
    N --> B
    A --> B
    M --> A
    B -->|success| C
    B -->|failure| K
    C --> D
    D --> E
    E --> F
    F -->|yes| G
    F -->|yes| H
    F -->|no| J
    H -->|partial| I
    L --> A
